<title>USA: Culver City USD, Calif. won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Culver City USD, Calif. won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $10 million of Culver City Unified Sch Dist, Calif., general obligation election of 1996 Series 1997 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.775 percent.</p>
</text>
